CodeAlpha Basic Chatbot
Description
This project is a simple rule-based chatbot developed using Python. It interacts with users by responding to predefined commands such as greetings, displaying the current date and time, introducing itself, and handling basic conversations.

Features
Greets the user
Displays the current date
Displays the current time
Introduces itself
Responds to basic conversation
Handles invalid input
Exit option using bye
Concepts Used
Functions
If-Else Statements
While Loop
Random Module
Datetime Module
User Input
How to Run
Open the project in Visual Studio Code.
Run Basic_Chatbot.py.
Interact with the chatbot by entering the available commands.
